@startuml

package "Python API Layer" {
  component "torc Public API" as TorcAPI
}

package "Application / Primary Task Layer" {
  component "Primary Application Task (rank 0)" as PrimaryApp
}

package "Task Runtime / Scheduling Layer" {
  component "Lifecycle Manager" as Lifecycle
  component "Submission / Queue Manager" as Submission
  component "Wait / Completion Manager" as Wait
  component "Callback Manager" as Callback
  component "Parallel Map Coordinator" as Map
  component "Task Stealing Manager" as Stealing
  component "Runtime Query Service" as Query
  component "Timing Service / gettime()" as Timing
  component "Server Runtime / Server Thread" as ServerRuntime
  component "Cyclic Assignment Policy" as CyclicAssignment
  component "Directed Submission Validator" as DirectedValidation
}

package "Worker Execution Layer" {
  component "Worker Threads / Execution Engine" as Workers
}

package "MPI Communication / Distribution Layer" {
  component "SPMD Bridge" as SPMD
  component "Internal MPI Transport" as MPITransport
}

package "Data / State Layer" {
  component "Task Descriptor / Future" as TaskDescriptor
  component "Worker Queue Store" as QueueStore
}

package "Configuration Layer" {
  component "Configuration Manager" as Config
}

package "Example / Demonstration Layer" {
  component "Image Preprocessing Workflow" as ImageWorkflow
  component "Example Suite" as Examples
}

package "External Systems / Platforms" {
  node "Python runtime" as PythonRuntime
  node "MPI runtime" as MPIRuntime
  component "mpi4py" as Mpi4py
  node "mpirun" as Mpirun
  component "termcolor" as Termcolor
  component "numpy" as Numpy
  component "cma" as Cma
  component "h5py" as H5py
  component "pillow" as Pillow
  database "HDF5" as HDF5
  database "Input image files organized in labeled subfolders" as Images
  node "Shared-memory platform" as SharedMem
  node "Distributed-memory platform" as DistMem
  node "Cluster nodes" as ClusterNodes
}

TorcAPI --> Lifecycle : start/init/launch/shutdown
TorcAPI --> Submission : submit
TorcAPI --> Wait : wait/as_completed
TorcAPI --> Map : map
TorcAPI --> SPMD : spmd
TorcAPI --> Stealing : enable/disable
TorcAPI --> Query : worker/node queries
TorcAPI --> Timing : gettime()
TorcAPI --> TaskDescriptor : task.input()/task.result()
TorcAPI --> PrimaryApp : start(f)

Lifecycle --> ServerRuntime : start/stop server runtime/thread
Lifecycle --> MPITransport : rank/launch coordination
Lifecycle --> Workers : worker execution control
Lifecycle --> PrimaryApp : launch rank-0 primary task

Submission --> QueueStore : create/queue descriptors
Submission --> TaskDescriptor : create descriptor
Submission --> CyclicAssignment : resolve default qid=-1
Submission --> DirectedValidation : validate directed qid
DirectedValidation --> QueueStore : place in target worker queue
DirectedValidation --> Submission : reject invalid qid
CyclicAssignment --> Workers : cyclic assignment across available workers

Config --> Stealing : TORC_STEALING
Config --> Workers : TORC_WORKERS / TORC_WORKER_YIELDTIME
Config --> ServerRuntime : TORC_SERVER_YIELDTIME

QueueStore --> Workers : provide tasks
QueueStore --> TaskDescriptor : hold task references
Workers --> TaskDescriptor : compute/return result
Workers --> Stealing : steal request when idle/empty local queue
Stealing --> Workers : deliver stolen tasks
Stealing --> QueueStore : retrieve stolen tasks
Stealing --> MPITransport : steal requests/results

Wait --> TaskDescriptor : await/read result
Wait --> Workers : release thread during waits
Wait --> Callback : parent completion notification
Callback --> TaskDescriptor : pass completed descriptor
Callback --> Workers : run callback task
Callback --> MPITransport : results returned to spawning rank

Map --> Submission : submit chunks
Map --> Wait : collect ordered results

Query --> MPITransport : rank/process queries
Query --> Workers : worker_id()/num_workers()/worker state
Query --> ServerRuntime : runtime/server state queries

SPMD --> MPITransport : coordinate SPMD execution across ranks
MPITransport --> Mpi4py : MPI communication
Mpi4py --> MPIRuntime : MPI bindings
Mpi4py --> PythonRuntime : Python package
Mpirun --> MPIRuntime : launches MPI processes

PrimaryApp --> Mpi4py : application MPI routines
PrimaryApp --> PythonRuntime : rank-0 application execution

ImageWorkflow --> Map : map-style image parallelism
ImageWorkflow --> Images : read labeled images
ImageWorkflow --> Pillow : load images
ImageWorkflow --> Numpy : build tensors
ImageWorkflow --> H5py : write HDF5
H5py --> HDF5 : access HDF5

Examples --> TorcAPI : documented API usage
Examples --> Cma : numerical optimization example
Examples --> Numpy : array examples
Examples --> Termcolor : formatted output

Workers --> PythonRuntime : execute Python functions
Workers --> SharedMem : shared-memory threads
MPIRuntime --> DistMem : distributed-memory processes
MPIRuntime --> ClusterNodes : cluster execution

@enduml
